      "content": "but even the \"tiny ways\" feel like they don't matter. even if i take an hour for myself, it's just a pause before the drowning starts again. it feels more like i'm just delaying the inevitable. i keep thinking about what it would be like if i wasn't here to have to deal with any of it. like, if i just wasn't part of the equation anymore. wouldn't that be the only real way to actually find that peace i keep thinking about? to just... be done with the struggle entirely?",
